{
  "id": "634",
  "title": "Wrong Number",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2018-12-22",
  "synopsis": "Someone calls Ben’s phone by mistake.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/926/ce9401043a8c88297582f89e1a1c3a8bc95f885f.mp3?1698350365",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "您打错了\n\n本：喂，您好！\n陌生人：陈总，您好您好！\n本：您打错了，我不是陈总。\n陌生人：您不是长城公司的陈总吗？\n本：不是。\n陌生人：啊，那不好意思，打错了。\n本：没事。\n陌生人：再见。\n本：再见。",
    "traditional": "您打錯了\n\n本：喂，您好！\n陌生人：陳總，您好您好！\n本：您打錯了，我不是陳總。\n陌生人：您不是長城公司的陳總嗎？\n本：不是。\n陌生人：啊，那不好意思，打錯了。\n本：沒事。\n陌生人：再見。\n本：再見。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "You called the wrong number."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "本：喂，您好！",
      "traditional": "本：喂，您好！",
      "pinyin": "běn wéi nín hǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Hello!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "陌生人：陈总，您好您好！",
      "traditional": "陌生人：陳總，您好您好！",
      "pinyin": "mò shēng rén chén zǒng nín hǎo nín hǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Stranger: Manager Chen, hello hello!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "本：您打错了，我不是陈总。",
      "traditional": "本：您打錯了，我不是陳總。",
      "pinyin": "běn nín dǎ cuò le wǒ bú shì chén zǒng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: You have called the wrong number. I am not manager Chen."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "陌生人：您不是长城公司的陈总吗？",
      "traditional": "陌生人：您不是長城公司的陳總嗎？",
      "pinyin": "mò shēng rén nín bú shì cháng chéng gōng sī de chén zǒng ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Stranger: Are you not manager Chen of the Great Wall Company?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "本：不是。",
      "traditional": "本：不是。",
      "pinyin": "běn bú shì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: No."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "陌生人：啊，那不好意思，打错了。",
      "traditional": "陌生人：啊，那不好意思，打錯了。",
      "pinyin": "mò shēng rén a nà bù hǎo yì si dǎ cuò le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Stranger: Ah, then I’m sorry. I dialed wrong."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "本：没事。",
      "traditional": "本：沒事。",
      "pinyin": "běn méi shì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: No problem."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "陌生人：再见。",
      "traditional": "陌生人：再見。",
      "pinyin": "mò shēng rén zài jiàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Stranger: Bye-bye."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "本：再见。",
